    description: "Layer-2 super-cluster from the connection sweep (connections-sweep 2026-06-08T1900Z). Cross-packet evidence: WI-mipul surfaced in both the confidence (C2) and run_signature (C3) investigations because override-analyze() skips the stamping path — one mechanism, two corrupted outputs. Children: run_signature staleness, hardcoded confidence, validation_report false-all-clear, and the compact finalize-after-shrink family (INV-fanur)."  # 396b
    fields:  # 396b
      statement: "Any field derived at construction time from default/placeholder inputs MUST be re-derived (or validated) against final/global state before serialization; the pipeline needs a finalize/reconcile step so run_signature, compact-shrunk dependent fields, edge confidence, and the validation_report agree with the substrate actually emitted."  # 396b
