  message: "SATISFIED — gate 5 of 6 (owner-affirmed twenty-pass convergence call, 2026-07-19). The ADR-0043 §6/§8 finalize-reconciliation gate is MET. MECHANISM: a single finalize(ctx) stage (finalize.py) whose body IS the order contract, wired at cli.py inside run_survey (=run_behavior_map); R2 (run_signature recompute strictly after the lifecycle stamp) and R3 (validate_ir structurally last, validating exactly what serializes) pinned by white-box tests; C2 filter-before-synthesis (Phase D tier+noise -> Phase E boundary synthesis) so the node/edge set is final on finalize entry (R1). ALL 5 CHILDREN RESOLVED: META-hufaz (run_signature) + INV-fanur (compact-shrunk) satisfied; META-ruhob (edge confidence) + META-fimas (validation_report) flipped satisfied this session; WI-pozur (ADR-0043 stage-ordering) done. FOUR STATEMENT CONCERNS PROVEN (fresh self-survey, corpus scale 40282 nodes/136269 edges/89 ARs, schema 0.14.6): (1) run_signature — 89/89 ARs self-consistent, 0 stale (re-hashed from final fields); (2) compact-shrunk dependent fields — recompute_view_summary re-derives post-shrink, proven by the non-vacuous INV-pazur end-to-end test; (3) edge confidence — by design NOT reconciled in finalize (ADR-0039 keeps per-edge confidence producer-side; the finalize slot was removed §6.1 #7); 8 evidence-keyed values, confidence_source 88.7% evidence_derived, no reconcile gap; (4) validation_report — enumerates 7 real defects (cross_field=6, id_format=1), counts consistent, computed structurally-last (R3) over the committed substrate. PRODUCTION-PATH TESTS: the 61-test closure set green (test_finalize_roundtrip.py + test_tiered_nodes_summary_inv_pazur.py + test_phase_de_reorder.py + test_finalize.py). No test gap found — the mechanism was already fully proven, so no property-test PR was warranted. RESIDUALS (none block the reconciliation gate): WI-humok reparented parent=null (release-gated quality.* removal); C3 script-noise governance tension filed WI-papag (needs_human_review) — ORTHOGONAL (Phase-D filtering is finalize's R1 precondition, not a reconciliation concern); C1 (validator:F3) + C4 (identity:F1) ADR-0043-documented, sibling-owned, forward-looking validator-coverage enhancements; tracker CLI parent-clear gap filed WI-vopuv. Gate scoreboard: 5 of 6 closed (INV-luhur, META-bifif, INV-jahiv, INV-numat, META-jalur); remaining = INV-fahub (deferred to Wave-5 end, pt.24 measurement-artifact reframe) + the mypy/INV-zogud prevention spine."  # afdf
